OL,3,GNEWSA'I tidy and wash up to help care
OL,4,Afor my mum'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Sometimes to help my mum I will do the
OL,7,Fwashing up and clean up the back
OL,8,Fgarden."
OL,10,FThat is what most days look like for
OL,11,Feight-year-old Willow, who took a break
OL,12,Ffrom her responsibilities by enjoying
OL,13,Fsome time out at an adventure park in
OL,14,FPoole.
OL,16,FMytime Young Carers organised the visit
OL,17,Fto help reduce the isolation and stress
OL,18,Fplaced on those who provide unpaid care
OL,19,Ffor a family member or loved one.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
